{
  "title": "[on-call] {{ .CommonLabels.alertname }} firing ({{ .CommonLabels.environment }})",
  "body": "@claude

An on-call alert opened this issue automatically. Investigate using Tempo/Loki/metrics for this service and environment, then implement and test a fix in `development` per `_docs/team/software-engineer.md`. See `_docs/on-call.md` for the full runbook. Never touch production directly.

**Alert:** {{ .CommonLabels.alertname }}
**Service:** {{ .CommonLabels.service }}
**Environment:** {{ .CommonLabels.environment }}
**Firing since:** {{ (index .Alerts.Firing 0).StartsAt }}
**Summary:** {{ .CommonAnnotations.summary }}
**Details:** {{ .CommonAnnotations.description }}
**Grafana:** {{ .ExternalURL }}
**Dashboard:** {{ .ExternalURL }}/d/call-center-api/call-center-api-request-telemetry?var-environment={{ .CommonLabels.environment }}

This body is generated only from alert metadata (name, service, environment, timing, dashboard links) -- it never includes raw log lines, query results, credentials, connection strings, or customer/note content.",
  "labels": ["on-call"]
}
